   "title": "Soften the onions",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pat steaks dry and season with the remaining salt.</li><li>Spread flour on a plate; coat each side lightly and shake off loose flour.</li><li>Keep the central bones in place for cooking and warn eaters about them.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
