   "title": "Dry and dust the fish",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat oil over medium-high heat.</li><li>Lay steaks in one layer; fry about 3–4 minutes per side, lowering heat if flour darkens quickly.</li><li>Turn with a broad spatula.</li><li>Check <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"63\" data-s=\"0\">63 °C</span></b> at the thickest flesh away from bone.</li><li>Use time as a guide; do not leave the centre raw.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
