   "title": "Fry; turn once",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Plate fish with the onion salad, optional parsley and lemon wedges.</li><li>Eat immediately, removing bones carefully.</li><li>Cold-chain failure is a reason to discard bonito: histamine is not reliably destroyed by cooking.</li></ul>",
